# Malamet Scythe: cast on turn 1 with no creature of Bot1's on the battlefield, its enters trigger has no target and is not put on
# the stack (CR 603.3d), so the Scythe stays unattached. On turn 3 Equip {4} (all four of Bot1's Moxen) attaches it to the Elvish
# Mystic (3/3, CR 702.6a). It is "only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d): not on the opponent's turn and not with a spell on the stack.
# On turn 5, once the Grizzly Bears has resolved, Equip {4} moves it: the Mystic is a 1/1 again and the Bears a 4/4 (CR 301.5c).

